Quantization

Quantization means reducing numerical precision.

Example:

FP32 → FP16 → INT8 → INT4

Memory:

32-bit = largest
16-bit = half
8-bit  = smaller
4-bit  = very small

Tradeoff:

Memory ↓
Speed ↑
Accuracy may slightly ↓



